					<h2 class="title-left">About Us</h2>
					<p>At <strong>Brad's Aerospace Private Limited</strong>, we're revolutionizing industrial inspection
						and surveying through our cutting-edge Drone as a Service (DAAS) platform. Our specialized fleet
						of industrial-grade drones delivers precision, efficiency, and unparalleled data insights for
						businesses across sectors.</p>
					<p>Founded by a young, dynamic team of aerospace engineers and data specialists, we bring fresh
						perspectives and innovative solutions to complex industrial challenges. Our expertise spans
						high-precision mapping, comprehensive infrastructure inspections, detailed topographical
						surveys, and advanced volumetric analysis—all delivered with the commitment to excellence that
						defines our brand.</p>
					<p>What sets us apart is our dedication to combining state-of-the-art drone technology with
