    <section class="s-pravicy-policy">
        <div class="container">
            <h3>Who We Are</h3>
            <p>Brad's Aerospace Private Limited is a leading provider of Drone as a Service (DAAS) solutions, specializing in industrial inspection and surveying. Our contact information:<br>
            Registered Office: [Company Address]<br>
            Website: <a href="https://www.bradsaerospace.com">www.bradsaerospace.com</a><br>
            Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@bradsaerospace.com">privacy@bradsaerospace.com</a></p>

            <h3>Data We Collect</h3>
            <p>In the course of providing our services, we may collect:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Client contact information (name, email, phone, company details)</li>
                <li>Flight operation data from drone sensors and cameras</li>
                <li>Geospatial data collected during surveys and inspections</li>
                <li>Technical logs and maintenance records for our equipment</li>
                <li>Website usage data through analytics cookies</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>How We Use Your Data</h3>
            <p>We use collected data to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Deliver and improve our DAAS solutions</li>
                <li>Generate analytical reports for clients</li>
                <li>Maintain safety and operational standards</li>
                <li>Communicate service updates and security notices</li>
                <li>Comply with aviation regulations and industry standards</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Data Security</h3>
            <p>We implement military-grade encryption for all flight data and client information. Our security measures include:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>256-bit SSL encryption for data transfers</li>
                <li>Regular security audits and penetration testing</li>
                <li>Multi-factor authentication for system access</li>
                <li>Secure cloud storage with geographic redundancy</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Third-Party Data Sharing</h3>
            <p>We may share data with:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Certified aviation authorities as required by regulation</li>
                <li>Cloud service providers under strict NDAs</li>
                <li>Technical partners for specialized data processing</li>
                <li>Legal authorities when required by law</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We never sell client data to third parties.</p>

            <h3>Data Retention</h3>
            <p>We retain operational data for 7 years to comply with aviation regulations. Client reports are maintained for 3 years post-service unless otherwise requested.</p>

            <h3>Your Rights</h3>
            <p>Under GDPR and other privacy regulations, you have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Request access to your personal data</li>
                <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
                <li>Request deletion of non-essential data</li>
                <li>Object to specific data processing activities</li>
                <li>Receive your data in portable format</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Cookies & Tracking</h3>
            <p>Our website uses essential and analytical cookies. Third-party services include:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Google Analytics for usage statistics</li>
                <li>Hotjar for user experience optimization</li>
                <li>Drone flight planning software cookies</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Policy Updates</h3>
            <p>This policy was last updated on [Date]. Significant changes will be communicated through our website and client portals.</p>

            <h3>Contact Us</h3>
            <p>For data requests or privacy concerns:<br>
            Data Protection Officer<br>
            Email: <a href="mailto:dpo@bradsaerospace.com">dpo@bradsaerospace.com</a><br>
            Phone: [Contact Number]</p>
        </div>
