                                    models offer a complete visual record that enhances communication among stakeholders
                                    and reduces disputes. By automating data collection, we eliminate the subjectivity
                                    and incompleteness of manual progress reports.</p>

                                <p>The integration of drone data with BIM models enables powerful comparison of as-built
                                    versus as-planned conditions. Our software automatically highlights deviations in
                                    structure placement, dimensions, and sequencing. This early detection of
                                    discrepancies allows for timely corrections before they become costly problems,
                                    improving project quality and schedule adherence.</p>

                                <p>For large-scale projects, our drone solutions provide consistent documentation across
                                    multiple work fronts simultaneously. Project managers gain unprecedented visibility
