                                    detect cracks, corrosion, deformation, and other defects without disrupting
                                    operations or endangering inspection personnel. This approach significantly reduces
                                    inspection costs while improving data quality and frequency.</p>

                                <p>For transportation authorities, our drone inspections cover extensive highway
                                    networks, rail lines, and tunnels in a fraction of the time required for
                                    ground-based methods. The detailed visual record enables precise condition
                                    assessment and prioritization of maintenance activities. By identifying developing
