                                <p>The inspection data is processed through AI-powered analytics that automatically flag
                                    potential issues and prioritize maintenance actions. Our comprehensive reports
                                    include precise GPS coordinates of defects, thermal comparisons, and severity
                                    assessments. This enables utilities to plan targeted maintenance, reducing outage
                                    risks and optimizing repair budgets.</p>

                                <p>Beyond visual and thermal inspection, our LiDAR-equipped drones capture precise
                                    measurements of conductor sag, clearance violations, and tower deformations. This
                                    data ensures compliance with safety regulations and helps prevent wildfires caused
                                    by vegetation contact. The combination of technologies provides a complete picture
                                    of grid health that was previously unattainable.</p>
                            </div>

