                                <h4>Renewable Energy Asset Management</h4>
                                <p>For solar farms, our drones equipped with high-resolution cameras and thermal sensors
                                    quickly scan large installations to identify underperforming panels, hotspots, and
                                    defects. This enables targeted maintenance that maximizes energy production and
                                    extends asset life. Our automated flight patterns ensure complete coverage of even
                                    the largest solar arrays with centimeter-level accuracy.</p>

                                <p>Wind turbine inspections benefit from our specialized close-proximity flight
                                    capabilities that capture detailed imagery of blades, nacelles, and towers. Using
                                    high-magnification cameras, we detect surface cracks, erosion, lightning damage, and
                                    other defects without requiring costly crane operations or production stoppages. Our
                                    reports document defect locations with precise references for maintenance teams.</p>

                                <p>Hydropower facilities utilize our drone solutions for dam inspections, penstock
                                    assessments, and reservoir monitoring. We provide access to difficult-to-reach
                                    structures while capturing comprehensive visual data and precise measurements. This
                                    approach reduces inspection costs while improving the quality and frequency of
                                    structural assessments.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="solution-item">
                                <h4>Pipeline and Oil & Gas Infrastructure</h4>
                                <p>Pipeline operators leverage our drone services for routine right-of-way monitoring,
                                    leak detection, and construction progress tracking. Using multispectral sensors and
                                    gas detection payloads, we identify vegetation encroachment, ground subsidence, and
                                    potential leaks along pipeline routes. This aerial perspective enables rapid
                                    assessment of hundreds of miles in a single day.</p>

                                <p>For oil and gas facilities, our drones conduct comprehensive inspections of tanks,
                                    flares, columns, and other critical infrastructure. Thermal imaging identifies
                                    insulation failures and process abnormalities, while visual inspections document
                                    corrosion and structural issues. By conducting inspections without scaffolding or
                                    shutdowns, we significantly reduce costs and safety risks.</p>

                                <p>Our offshore inspection capabilities include rig and platform surveys using
                                    specialized drones capable of operating in challenging marine environments. We
                                    capture high-resolution imagery and video for structural assessment, safety
                                    compliance, and maintenance planning. This approach minimizes the need for personnel
                                    transfers and reduces exposure to hazardous environments.</p>
