                                <p>Energy companies achieve 40-60% cost savings compared to traditional inspection
                                    methods by eliminating the need for specialized access equipment, production
                                    shutdowns, and large field crews. Drones complete inspections in a fraction of the
                                    time, reducing labor costs and minimizing operational disruptions. The efficiency
