                                    chemical plumes, and particulate matter dispersion, providing real-time data for
                                    regulatory enforcement and pollution control. This approach enables rapid response
                                    to environmental incidents.</p>

                                <p>Water quality monitoring utilizes our specialized payloads that detect algae blooms,
                                    chemical spills, and sedimentation. Using multispectral sensors, we map chlorophyll
                                    concentrations, turbidity patterns, and temperature gradients across water bodies.
