                                    systems for water quality issues.</p>

                                <p>For industrial compliance, our drones monitor facility emissions and detect fugitive
                                    releases that might violate environmental regulations. We provide objective
                                    documentation of compliance status and identify potential problem areas for
                                    corrective action. This proactive approach helps companies maintain environmental
                                    standards and avoid penalties.</p>
