                                    mapping and erosion assessment. Using high-resolution photogrammetry and LiDAR, we
                                    quantify beach profiles, dune migration, and cliff erosion with centimeter-level
                                    accuracy. This data supports coastal protection planning and climate change
                                    adaptation strategies.</p>

                                <p>For riverine environments, our drones monitor bank erosion, sediment transport, and
                                    floodplain changes. We detect erosion hotspots, measure sediment accumulation, and
                                    assess riparian vegetation health. This comprehensive perspective enables better
                                    watershed management and flood risk assessment.</p>

                                <p>Coral reef monitoring benefits from our specialized underwater drones and aerial
                                    mapping capabilities. We assess reef health, bleaching events, and structural
                                    complexity using multispectral imaging and 3D modeling. This data supports marine
