                                    technology. Our specialized systems capture detailed imagery of flare tips,
                                    structural supports, and refractory lining without requiring shutdowns or erecting
                                    scaffolding. Thermal imaging identifies hot spots and combustion efficiency issues,
                                    while visual inspection documents structural integrity and corrosion.</p>

                                <p>For storage tank inspections, our drones conduct external roof and shell assessments
                                    while minimizing confined space entries. We identify corrosion, coating failures,
