                                    cameras and thermal sensors. The aerial perspective enables rapid assessment of
                                    hard-to-access areas without requiring rope access or scaffolding.</p>

                                <p>Subsea inspection capabilities include above-water assessment of risers, mooring
                                    systems, and floating structures. Our drones capture detailed imagery of splash
                                    zones and tidal areas that are challenging for divers or ROVs. By conducting
                                    inspections without vessel support in many cases, we significantly reduce
                                    operational costs and carbon footprint.</p>

